{"id":"ef7efb192e321ef0","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-general-quantifier.md","title":"任意基态射上的量词","display":"df-general-quantifier — 任意基态射上的量词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-general-quantifier","aliases":["16-df-general-quantifier","General quantifiers in a fibration"],"display":"df-general-quantifier — 任意基态射上的量词","depends_on":["[[16-df-substitution]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source":"Definition 1.9.4, p.97 (PDF117), adjoint-existence component; BC is a separate condition","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-general-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-general-quantifier</span><span>General quantifiers in a fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-general-quantifier — 任意基态射上的量词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.9.4, p.97 (PDF117), adjoint-existence component; BC is a separate condition"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为带提升选择的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\">\\(u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccfbb871fa39931c\" href=\"?note=ccfbb871fa39931c\" title=\"16-df-substitution\">16-df-substitution</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>伴随采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>，候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J\">\\(\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenQuant}\">\\(\\mathrm{GenQuant}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasPi}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasPi}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HasSigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{HasSigma}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}general\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Sigma_u)\\ \\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Pi_u)\\ u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}general\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Sigma_u)\\ \\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Pi_u)\\ u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}(p)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>选定伴随后分别有自然双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_J(\\Sigma_uX,Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(X,u^*Y)\">\\(\\mathcal E_J(\\Sigma_uX,Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(X,u^*Y)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,X)\\cong\\mathcal E_J(Y,\\Pi_uX)\">\\(\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,X)\\cong\\mathcal E_J(Y,\\Pi_uX)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在伴随与满足 Beck–Chevalley 是不同条件；左、右量词也可以分别存在。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 1.9.4，印刷97/PDF117。此页保留其任意基箭头上的伴随存在性部分；原书完整products/coproducts条件还含相应BC，不能仅从本页存在谓词推出。旧来源§9.2实际是逻辑谓词与关系，现予纠正。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ccfbb871fa39931c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u:I\\to J$，$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 见 [[16-df-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"伴随采用 [[16-df-adjoint-functors]]，候选 $\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_u,\\Pi_u:\\mathcal E_I\\to\\mathcal E_J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenQuant}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasPi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HasSigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}general\\text{-}quantifier}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Sigma_u)\\ \\Sigma_u\\dashv u^*,\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\exists\\Pi_u)\\ u^*\\dashv\\Pi_u,\\\\\n\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HasSigma}_p(u)\\land\\mathrm{HasPi}_p(u),\\\\\n\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}(p)&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B)\\mathrm{GenQuant}_p(u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_J(\\Sigma_uX,Y)\\cong\\mathcal E_I(X,u^*Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_I(u^*Y,X)\\cong\\mathcal E_J(Y,\\Pi_uX)","display":false}],"bytes":1987,"backlinks":[{"id":"86e53aa076639692","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；重索引与伴随采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]。$S=(u',v',v,u)$，$u':I'\\to J'$、$v':I'\\to I$、$v:J'\\to J$、$u:I\\to J$，满足 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 的 $\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(u',v';v,u)$。"},{"id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HasGenQuant}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$、$\\mathrm{Frob}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]；后两者的量化范围为所有基态射和所有存在的拉回方块。$\\mathrm{LogicFib}$ 是本页定义的组合性质。"},{"id":"59e96b6fa0700cc7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，$u:I\\to J$，$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$；采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]] 的伴随存在谓词。$\\mathsf{HasQuant}_p$ 如下定义，不依赖游离的候选函子。"},{"id":"d5e50a47d180cbce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化，基范畴具有所选有限积；$\\pi:I\\times J\\to I$。$\\mathrm{HasSigma},\\mathrm{HasPi}$ 采用 [[16-df-general-quantifier]]。当这些性质成立时，$\\exists_\\pi,\\forall_\\pi$ 取同一指定伴随见证。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["ccfbb871fa39931c","a88937ea87ff8530"]}